    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "British\nalrways\nHUGHES\nAIRWEST\nand\nGolden Gateway Service\nLondon to Western USA\nvia San Francisco\nBA287 Daily* 747\ndeparts London 2:30 pm\narrives San Francisco 5:30 pm.\nDaily connections by Hughes Airwest from\nSan Francisco to: Arizona, California and Oregon.\nTo\nChico\nEureka/ Arcata\nKlamath Falls\nRedding\nRedmond\nSacramento\nTucson\nDep. SFO Arr.\nCal. 7:05 pm\n7:45 pm\nCal. 7:50 pm\n8:45 pm\nOre.\n7:05 pm\n8:37 pm\nCal.\n7:40 pm\n8:26 pm\n..Ore. 7:05 pm\n9:32 pm\n..Cal. 8:10 pm\n8:44 pm\nAriz. 7:35 pm\n10:16 pm\nRW FIt. No.\n934\n942\n934\n883\n934\n8\n727\nBritish Airways flies to London from over 120\ncities in Britain, Europe and beyond.\nFor reservations and information in U.K. telephone\nLondon (01)370-5411, Glasgow (041)332-9666,\nManchester (061)228-6311.\n*October 1 - 28 not Tuesdays and Wednesdays\nOctober 29 - April 28, 1979 not Mondays, Wednesdays and Fridays.",
      "HUGHES\nAIRWEST\nBritish\nairways\nand\nGolden Gateway Service\nWestern USA to London\nvia San Francisco\nBA286 Daily* non-stop 747\ndeparts San Francisco 8 pm\narrives London 2 pm next day.\nDaily connections by Hughes Airwest from:\nArizona, California, Nevada, Oregon and Washington\nFrom\nDep.\nArr. SFO RW FIt. No.\nChico\nCal. 5:55 pm\n6:34 pm\n933\nEugene\nOre. 4:45 pm\n5:59 pm\n729\nEureka/ Arcata\nCal. 3:45 pm\n4:35 pm\n946\nGrand Canyon... Ariz. 4:15 pm\n7:00 pm\n883\nKlamath Falls\nOre. 5:05 pm\n6:34 pm\n933\nLas Vegas\nNev. 5:15 pm\n7:00 pm\n883\nOakland\nCal. 6:45 pm\n7:00 pm\n883\nPasco ..\nWash. 5:25 pm\n7:00 pm\n727\nRedmond\nOre. 4:10 pm\n6:34 pm\n933\nTucson\nAriz. 2:35 pm\n5:31 pm\n785\nYakima\nWash. 4:35 pm\n7:00 pm\n727\nFrom London, British Airways flies to over\n120 cities in Britain, Europe and beyond\nConcorde flies London/Bahrain on\nSunday, Wednesday and Friday.\nFor reservations call your travel agent, Company Traffic\nManager, Hughes Airwest or British Airways.\n*October 1 - 28 not Tuesdays and Wednesdays\nOctober 29 - April 28. 1979 not Mondays. Wednesdays, Fridays\n8958"
